# Normalize to LF in the repository. This matters more here than in most projects:
# these scripts are read and executed on Windows, macOS, and Linux, and a chunk of
# the defects this codebase exists to fix were line-ending and encoding problems
# that only appeared on one platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are inputs to tests that assert byte-level behaviour. Git must not
# rewrite them on checkout, or a test that checks encoding or line endings would
# be measuring what Git did rather than what the code did.
skills/better-skill-creator/tests/fixtures/** -text

# Binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.skill binary
